/bin/
*.test
*.out
.env

# Local-only working files, deliberately not published.
# Prompt.md holds the internal product brief and the security audit that drove
# this work; .claude/ holds local tooling config. Neither belongs in a public
# repository, and both are referenced by nothing the build needs.
/Prompt.md
/.claude/

# Benchmark corpora are fetched, not vendored: they are third-party data, and
# committing them would both bloat the repo and invite the suspicion that the
# numbers were measured on a corpus we curated.
/eval/corpus/
